<section xml:id="policies" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Course Policies and Procedures</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>
      At a minimum, all policies stated in the current <url href="https://www.latech.edu/documents/student-life/student-handbook.pdf">Louisiana Tech University Student Handbook</url> should be followed.
      Additional class policies follow.
    </p>
    <p>
      This syllabus is posted on Canvas.
      Every student is responsible for accessing it, reading it in full, and following the policies it contains; a paper copy will not be distributed.
    </p>
  </introduction>
  
